    "about": "HERE Pittsburgh is a modern student housing in Pittsburgh, located at 3506 Forbes Ave, Pittsburgh, PA 15213. The HERE apartments is just 8-minute walking to University of Pittsburgh, and 6-minute cycling to Carnegie Mellon University. HERE Pittsburgh offers room types including studios, 1, 2, and 3-bedroom, featuring iconic designs, edgy decorations, spacious layouts, upscale amenities, and light-filled spaces. Each unit in HERE apartments contains wood-style flooring, TV, keyless entry, in-unit washer and dryer. The open-concept modern kitchen is equipped with a dishwasher, refrigerator, stove, oven, microwave, stainless steel appliances, and cabinets. Inside the cozy bedroom, you will find a bed, a desk, a chair, a nightstand, large windows, and window coverings. The bathroom in the HERE Pittsburgh is also fully-equipped, boasting a shower, toilet, sink and a large mirror. HERE apartments Pittsburgh is pet-friendly, welcoming your furry friends. At HERE Pittsburgh, residents can also enjoy incredible social spaces and high-end shared amenities. Stay active in the state-of-the-art fitness center, get ready for exams in the study lounge, play games in the clubhouse, have a BBQ in the outdoor grilling areas, or take advantages of the HERE Pittsburgh's communal kitchen, coffee bar, PC room, sundeck, courtyard, outdoor lounge, mail room, package room, and bike storage. Around HERE Pittsburgh, there are endless dining, shopping, and recreation options for you to explore. Additionally, HERE apartments is only 1-minute walk to the Forbes Ave + McKee Pl bus stop, bringing much convenience for residents to commute and travel around the city. Want to find out more about HERE Pittsburgh? Call to schedule a visit of the HERE apartments at 3506 Forbes Ave, Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania, today.",
